  "prefLabel": "Adm 202.03 Construction of Rules",
  "priorExpiration": "1991-05-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 202.03 Construction of Rules. Parts Adm 203 - Adm 211 shall be construed so as to foster the just, accurate and efficient resolution of all disputes in accordance with applicable law, including but not limited to the provisions of RSA 541-A: 31 – 38.\n\nSource. #2235, eff 12-30-82; ss by #3032, eff 5-31-85, EXPIRED: 5-31-91\n\nNew. #7102, eff 9-23-99; ss by #8908, eff 9-22-07",
